{
"#name"
:
{
"install"
:
null
,
"en"
:
"Cross-platform installer for software, skills, and more"
,
"cn"
:
"跨平台安装器，支持软件、skill 等安装"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Query installation methods and install software — interactively, with auto best-match for CI/CD, or structured output for AI agents"
,
"cn"
:
"查询安装方法并安装软件 —— 支持交互式选择、CI/CD 自动最佳匹配、AI Agent 结构化输出"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x install [policy] [software]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x install --printinfo <software>"
:
null
}
,
{
"x install --printcmd <software>"
:
null
}
,
{
"x install --best <software>"
:
null
}
,
{
"x install --withtool <tool> <software>"
:
null
}
]
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"支持批量安装多个软件，也支持安装 skill（skill/* 或 clawhub/* 格式）。\n支持前缀格式快速指定安装来源：brew/jq、apt/git、npm/express、sys/bun、best/jq。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Supports batch install of multiple software, and skill installation (skill/* or clawhub/* format).\nPrefix format for quick source selection: brew/jq, apt/git, npm/express, sys/fzf, best/jq.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"x install 默认进入交互模式，列出当前平台所有可用安装方法供选择。\n"
,
"en"
:
"x install enters interactive mode by default, listing all available methods for the current platform.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"自动化安装有三种方式，按需选择：\n1. --best — 按优先级自动选择最佳方法并执行，适合 CI/CD。可用 --priority 自定义优先级。\n2. --withtool — 使用指定包管理器。默认查找收录的安装方法，加 --direct 则直接调用包管理器。\n3. --sys — 使用系统包管理器（如 ubuntu 用 apt，macOS 用 brew）。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Three ways for automated install:\n1. --best — auto-select best method by priority and execute, for CI/CD. Use --priority to customize.\n2. --withtool — use specified tool. Looks up recorded methods by default; add --direct to call tool directly.\n3. --sys — use system package manager (apt on Ubuntu, brew on macOS).\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"--printinfo 和 --printcmd 用于只查询不执行，适合 AI Agent 或脚本集成。\n1. --printinfo 输出详细信息和所有安装方法，--printcmd 仅输出安装命令。\n2. 当与 --best 组合时（--best --printcmd），只查询最佳方法的信息而不执行。\n3. --available-tool 查询当前系统支持的包管理器，加 --installed 仅显示已安装的。\n"
,
"en"
:
"--printinfo and --printcmd query without executing, suitable for AI agents or script integration.\n1. --printinfo outputs detailed info and all methods; --printcmd outputs install commands only.\n2. When combined with --best (--best --printcmd), only queries the best method without executing.\n3. --available-tool queries supported package managers; add --installed to show installed only.\n"
}
]
,
"--ls"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"List all software supported by the install module"
,
"cn"
:
"列出 install 模块收录的所有软件"
}
,
"--tsv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Output the full software index in TSV format"
,
"cn"
:
"以 TSV 格式输出完整的软件索引"
}
}
,
"--csv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Output the full software index in CSV format"
,
"cn"
:
"以 CSV 格式输出完整的软件索引"
}
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x install --ls"
,
"en"
:
"List all supported software (interactive UI in terminal)"
,
"cn"
:
"列出所有支持的软件（终端下启用交互 UI）"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x install --ls --tsv"
,
"en"
:
"Output all software index in TSV format"
,
"cn"
:
"以 TSV 格式输出所有软件索引"
}
]
}
,
"--fzf|--fz"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Enable the interactive fzf UI for the install module"
,
"cn"
:
"启用 install 模块的 fzf 交互式 UI"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x install"
,
"en"
:
"Enable the interactive fzf UI for the install module"
,
"cn"
:
"启用 install 模块的 fzf 交互式 UI"
}
]
}
,
"--printinfo|--cat"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Print detailed information and all installation methods for a software (without executing)"
,
